    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="18">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 18</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">[Be horsum.] [Ld] Seofoðe: þæt nan mon ne sylle nan hors ofer sǽ, buton he hit gifan wille.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Seventhly [we declare] that no man shall send any horse across the sea unless he wishes to make a present of it.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be horsum. Nán man ne sylle nan hors ofer sæ, butan he hit gyfan wille.</ab>
      </div>
